      "raw_local_commit_utf8": "tree d7768f5f392cef417e59ccadfc29f20d3f67f707\nparent b066586448823ffcc1ef406da5490f897fc4e3f2\nauthor Codex <codex@openai.com> 1794989820 -0700\ncommitter Codex <codex@openai.com> 1794989820 -0700\n\nComplete P03 input inventory and required control-body braces\n\nInclude source .inc files and SoftFloat RISCV headers in the frozen\nqualification inventory, closing the two gaps found by comparing actual\ncompiler dependencies. Correct stale manifest next-step prose.\n\nAdd required braces to new/touched C++ control bodies and normalize the\nnew lifecycle test indentation. Independent delivery review confirmed\nall nine C++ diffs preserve every nonbrace/nonwhitespace byte and add\n142 balanced brace pairs. No operator arithmetic or runtime behavior\nchanges in this correction.\n\nValidation: 45 focused P03 tests, project governance and diff checks\npass. DP-F01 independently resolved by delivery_audit. Earlier running\nqualification attempts were explicitly interrupted and retained before\nthis correction; fresh full qualification follows this exact commit.\n",
